---
// One-line thesis bar at the very top of every page, under the four-block stripe.
---
<aside class="pov">
  <span class="tag">POV</span>
  <span class="text">
    Entry-level IT work is being rewritten by AI faster than community-college curriculum can absorb.
    <span class="hl">I'm working on closing that gap.</span>
  </span>
</aside>

<style>
  .pov {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -.005em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }
  .pov::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto 0;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--stripe);
  }
  .tag {
    background: var(--sun);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    padding: 0 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .text { padding: 12px 18px; }
  .hl { color: var(--sun); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .pov { font-size: 13px; justify-content: flex-start; }
    .text { padding: 11px 14px; }
  }
</style>
